      <section class="scene scene--1"><div class="scene-kicker">01 / DEFINE</div><h3>Start with the decision.</h3><p>The question sets the research boundary before collection begins.</p><div class="decision-question"><small>DECISION QUESTION</small><strong>Which competitor is better supported for this team’s move?</strong></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--2"><div class="scene-kicker">02 / COLLECT</div><h3>Open the public evidence field.</h3><div class="source-cloud"><span>Pricing page</span><span>Documentation</span><span>Changelog</span><span>Product page</span><span>Help centre</span><span>Reviews</span></div><div class="axis-orbit"><i></i><b>PUBLIC SOURCES</b></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--3"><div class="scene-kicker">03 / OBSERVE</div><h3>Record what the source actually shows.</h3><div class="source-page"><span>PUBLIC PAGE</span><b>Capability described on the source page</b><mark>Observed statement — captured before interpretation</mark></div><div class="observation-card"><small>OBSERVATION</small><strong>Plain-language source record</strong><em>checked / dated / openable</em></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--4"><div class="scene-kicker">04 / CLASSIFY</div><h3>Force every material claim into a visible state.</h3><div class="state-grid"><article class="fact"><small>FACT</small><b>Directly supported</b><span>Verified evidence</span></article><article class="infer"><small>INFERENCE</small><b>Reasoned conclusion</b><span>Interpretation shown</span></article><article class="unknown"><small>UNKNOWN</small><b>Not established</b><span>Certainty stops here</span></article></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--5"><div class="scene-kicker">05 / MATRIX</div><h3>Build the evidence matrix.</h3><div class="matrix"><div class="m-head"><span>CLAIM</span><span>STATE</span><span>SOURCE</span><span>USE</span></div><div><b>AI resolution pricing</b><em class="fact">FACT</em><span>Official pricing</span><span>Cost mechanic</span></div><div><b>Packaging trade-off</b><em class="infer">INFERENCE</em><span>Pricing + docs</span><span>Plan choice</span></div><div><b>Team-specific cost</b><em class="unknown">UNKNOWN</em><span>Not public</span><span>Ask before buy</span></div></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--6"><div class="scene-kicker">06 / KEEP OPEN</div><h3>Unknowns remain visible.</h3><div class="unknown-field"><span>Private usage</span><span>Roadmap intent</span><span>Internal adoption</span><span>Negotiated terms</span><div class="certainty-line"><b>PUBLIC EVIDENCE</b><i></i><strong>CERTAINTY ENDS HERE</strong></div></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--7"><div class="scene-kicker">07 / COMPARE</div><h3>Turn evidence into a readable comparison.</h3><div class="chart-card"><div class="bars"><i style="--h:46%"></i><i style="--h:72%"></i><i style="--h:55%"></i><i style="--h:84%"></i><i style="--h:65%"></i></div><footer><span>PLAN</span><span>AI</span><span>USAGE</span><span>SCOPE</span></footer></div><div class="chart-note"><small>PUBLIC MECHANICS</small><b>Comparable where public</b><span>Team-specific economics remain a separate question.</span></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--8"><div class="scene-kicker">08 / TRACE</div><h3>Every implication has a path backward.</h3><div class="trace"><span>SOURCE</span><i></i><span>OBSERVATION</span><i></i><span>FACT</span><i></i><span>INFERENCE</span><i></i><strong>MOVE</strong></div><div class="trace-card"><small>WHY THIS CONCLUSION?</small><b>Open the trail, inspect the reasoning, challenge the move.</b></div></section>
      <section class="scene scene--9"><div class="scene-kicker">09 / DELIVER</div><div class="final-brief"><div><small>DECISION OUTPUT</small><h3>Decision-Ready Brief</h3><p>Evidence separated from judgment. Unknowns kept visible. The next move tied to what the evidence can actually support.</p><footer>SOURCE → OBSERVATION → FACT → INFERENCE → MOVE</footer></div><div class="brief-sheet"><span>EXECUTIVE BRIEF</span><b>What is supported?</b><b>What is inferred?</b><b>What remains open?</b><em>READY</em></div></div></section>
    </div>
